    <section class="legal-block" id="changes">
      <span class="legal-n">11</span>
      <div>
        <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>If we change them, we'll move the date at the top, and for anything material we'll say so in the studio. Carrying on using it after that means you accept the new version; if you'd rather not, stop using it and ask us to delete your data.</p>
